3106     ImDrawFlags_RoundCornersTopRight        = 1 << 5, {\cf20 // AddRect(), AddRectFilled(), PathRect(): enable rounding top-right corner only (when rounding > 0.0f, we default to all corners). Was 0x02.}\par
3107     ImDrawFlags_RoundCornersBottomLeft      = 1 << 6, {\cf20 // AddRect(), AddRectFilled(), PathRect(): enable rounding bottom-left corner only (when rounding > 0.0f, we default to all corners). Was 0x04.}\par
