3584 {\cf20 // - About Main Area vs Work Area:}\par
3585 {\cf20 //   - Main Area = entire viewport.}\par
3586 {\cf20 //   - Work Area = entire viewport minus sections used by main menu bars (for platform windows), or by task bar (for platform monitor).}\par
